===Etymology===
From Arabic {{Arab|[[حماس]]}} (ḥamās), an acronym (meaning literally ‘enthusiasm’) for {{Arab|حركة المقاومة الاسلامية}} (ḥarakat al-muqāwama al-islāmīya) ‘Islamic Resistance Movement’.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

